<title>USA: Old America Q3 profit depends on Oct sales.</title>
<headline>Old America Q3 profit depends on Oct sales.</headline>
<dateline>HOWE, Texas 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Old America Stores Inc said on Wednesday that its profitability for the third quarter will depend on dramatically improved same-store sales in October, since hurricanes hurt the company's operations in September.</p>
<p>In last year's third quarter, the company reported profits of $8,000 on sales of $39.6 million.</p>
